    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49800" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undōsus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		unda, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>full of waves</i> or <i>surges</i>, <i>surgy</i>, <i>billowy</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aequor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 4, 313</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Plemyrium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 693</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil. 5,
					21</span></i>
			.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fluctus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sol. 12 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			—<i>Sup.</i>: torrentes, Aug. Civ.
			Dei, 27, 11. —<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undōsē</span></b> , <i>in waves; comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undosius labens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 27, 4, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
